3
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:08,240
Nanti pengarang akan bahas maksud dia.

4
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:10,240
Maka apa kita nak buat?

5
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:13,240
Fa iza tatha'aba ahadukum.

6
00:00:13,240 --> 00:00:14,600
Bila mana?

7
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:16,480
Maka apabila menguap seorang

8
00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:17,240
