9
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:19,861
Fal yakzim mastata'a.

10
00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:24,240
Maka hendaklah tahan ia sekuasanya.

11
00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:28,240
Bila mari menguap tu Nabi kata?

12
00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:30,640
Fal yakzim.

13
00:00:32,240 --> 00:00:35,240
Kazama, kazama ni tahan.

14
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:37,940
Kalau orang marah, kemudian tahan

15
00:00:37,940 --> 00:00:40,240
marah, dia kazimul ghaiz.

16
00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:42,500
Wal kazimin al-ghaiza,

17
00:00:43,240 --> 00:00:45,240
wal 'afina 'anin nas.

18
00:00:45,240 --> 00:00:47,830
Orang yang kazim al-ghaiz, orang

19
00:00:47,830 --> 00:00:50,240
