20
00:00:50,240 --> 00:00:54,450
Al-ghaiz ni kemarahan yang meluap-luap.

21
00:00:56,240 --> 00:00:58,500
Bila dia boleh tahan kemarahan yang

22
00:00:58,500 --> 00:00:59,800
meluap-luap, daripada

23
00:01:00,150 --> 00:01:01,770
dia ada kemarahan,

24
00:01:02,280 --> 00:01:03,240
dia boleh tahan.

25
00:01:03,240 --> 00:01:05,950
Wal 'afina 'anin nas, orang yang

26
00:01:05,950 --> 00:01:09,240
memaafkan manusia, dia orang yang baik.

27
00:01:09,240 --> 00:01:13,240
Kita nak ambil perkataan kazama, tahan.

28
00:01:13,240 --> 00:01:15,240
Nabi kata dia kena tahan.

29
00:01:15,240 --> 00:01:16,440
Mastata'a,

30
00:01:17,280 --> 00:01:19,240
