35
00:01:28,240 --> 00:01:31,240
Mari menguap, buat tahan.

36
00:01:31,240 --> 00:01:33,240
Tutup mulut.

37
00:01:33,240 --> 00:01:34,513
Eh, tak?

38
00:01:34,513 --> 00:01:35,240
Nak?

39
00:01:35,240 --> 00:01:36,660
Kalau ikut nak menguap tu, mulut

40
00:01:36,660 --> 00:01:37,240
